  "description": "Support package, not an SDK: install VisioForge.DotNet.VideoCapture (or VisioForge.DotNet.Core) first and add this one when you use its Windows DirectShow engine and the deployment guide lists it. DirectShow filters for the VisioForge Video Capture SDK .NET on Windows x86: Desktop Duplication screen capture, Decklink and ASIO sources, What-You-Hear audio, MJPEG decoder, GMFBridge for separate capture. LAME MP3, the MP3 splitter, the Matroska/SSF muxers and the RTSP sink come from its dependency VisioForge.DotNet.Core.Redist.Base.x86.",
